  "description": "In another world, a fierce power struggle rages between two factions: [Green Dragon & Orcs] vs. [Gold Dragon & Elves]. Amid this conflict, Sergeant Lee Geon — a living legend of the modern battlefield — is reborn as an orc with a powerful ability to tame monsters. A modern soldier's instincts and battlefield experience, now wielded in a fantasy world through the body of an orc with the rarest of abilities. The sergeant's new war is about to begin.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851032), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14208466)",
